ous 10-second high-intensity combat sequence between an immortal swordsman and a demonic warrior on a desolate cliff edge. The action starts immediately with a devastating impact, escalating through close-quarters combat, aerial evasion, and a final collision of magical energy, leaving a cliffhanger state for continuation.\n\nretention_analysis:\n\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2], [Shot 3], [Shot 4]): fully_preserved - Preserve the elder's facial features, silver hair, white robes with gold embroidery, and jade accessories while allowing fluid martial arts movements.\n\n<Subject 2> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2], [Shot 3], [Shot 4]): fully_preserved - Preserve the warrior's black spiked armor, muscular build, long black hair, glowing red eyes, and tattered red cape while executing heavy combat motions.\n\n<Subject 3> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2], [Shot 3], [Shot 4]): fully_preserved - Preserve the dark, cracked stone cliff and the deep chasm below, maintaining the cold, ominous atmosphere.\n\n<Subject 4> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 4]): fully_preserved - Preserve the broken blades and bamboo flute, allowing them to be physically displaced by the intense shockwaves.\n\ndetailed_description:\n\n[Shot 1] The camera is a low-angle tracking shot starting on the cracked cliff edge. At 00:00.000, <Subject 2> aggressively slams down from above, smashing his right fist into <Subject 1>'s raised golden spiritual barrier. The impact creates a massive shockwave, shattering the ground and sending broken blades and the bamboo flute (<Subject 4>) flying into the air. The dark-armored warrior's red cape billows violently.\n\n[Shot 2] At 00:02.300, the camera cuts to a medium side-tracking shot. <Subject 1> slides backward from the force, his white robes and silver hair fluttering, and instantly draws his longsword, unleashing a sweeping golden sword aura. <Subject 2> crosses his arms to block. Sparks fly from his black spiked gauntlets as the sword aura pushes him back, carving two deep trenches into the stone ground. <Subject 2> grins with glowing red eyes.\n\n[Shot 3] At 00:04.800, the camera transitions to a wide aerial shot, circling the characters. <Subject 2> bursts forward with dark energy, throwing a rapid combination of heavy punches. <Subject 1> utilizes ethereal movement, stepping onto a floating piece of a broken blade (<Subject 4>) to launch himself high into the air. The elder hurls his sword. The flying sword streaks like a golden meteor toward the warrior's back.\n\n[Shot 4] At 00:07.500, the camera dynamically arcs downwards. <Subject 2> spins, deflecting the flying sword with a powerful backhand. Simultaneously, <Subject 1> descends from the sky, both hands gathering a dense sphere of golden spiritual energy. He thrusts it down towards <Subject 2>. <Subject 2> roars, his red eyes flaring, and throws a massive uppercut with his fist wrapped in dark crimson energy to meet the attack. The camera cuts to a tight low-angle shot right before the collision, freezing on the intense expressions and the swirling debris as the energies are about to clash at 00:09.800. Dust and broken shards sweep outward, leaving the scene in a state of continuous, unresolved kinetic tension.\n\noverall_soundscape:\n\nHeavy, bone-crushing impacts of armor and stone, sharp metallic clangs of sword against gauntlet, whooshing sword aura, the rustle of heavy capes and silk robes in the wind, deep rumbling of the ground cracking, and the whirling sound of displaced air and debris.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\n\nA high-tempo, intense fusion of traditional Chinese orchestral drums and modern cinematic low-frequency pulses. The music starts with a heavy, thunderous impact and maintains a driving, escalating rhythm, building tension without fully resolving, setting up for the climactic finale in the next segment."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "值"}], "flags": {}, "type"